Chapter: ExplorerData

 Shared content data for all explorer pages. All item types, materials,
 rarities, conditions, enchantments, races, classes, biomes, etc. live
 here. Pages cite this chapter and query the data they need.

 Single source of truth — adding an item type or biome here makes it
 available on every page that uses the relevant list.

 We say:

Section: Item Types

  ItemCategory = record { name : Text, prompt : Text }

  item-categories : List ItemCategory
  item-categories = [
